{"author":["Elastic"],"description":"检测来自互联网的ICMP时间戳或信息请求。对应需求：侦察发现。官方：ICMP Timestamp or Information Request from the Internet。","from":"now-9m","index":["logs-network_traffic.icmp-*"],"language":"kuery","license":"Elastic License v2","name":"【默认】来自互联网的ICMP时间戳或信息请求","note":"## 调查指引\n\n### 规则说明\n来自互联网的ICMP时间戳或信息请求\n\n### 为何重要\n摸清账号、网络、主机或云资源\n\n### 调查步骤\n1. 核对告警实体、进程/网络字段与时间窗。\n2. 核对是否符合变更窗口与已知业务工具。\n3. 关联同主机或同账号前后同类告警。\n\n### 常见误报\n- 合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描\n\n### 响应建议\n1. 确认是否授权与变更窗口。\n2. 无授权则隔离相关主机或账号并排查落地与外连。\n3. 按主机与用户关联前后同类告警。\n","references":["https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc792","https://nmap.org/book/host-discovery-techniques.html","https://www.iana.org/assignments/iana-ipv4-special-registry/iana-ipv4-special-registry.xhtml"],"risk_score":21,"rule_id":"81139742-4d3a-49f3-a6dd-e0fb9834f959","setup":"## 设置说明\n\n1. 接入边界或主机网络日志（Packetbeat、防火墙、云流量等，按规则数据源）。\n2. 确认相关数据流有数据后再评估告警。\n","severity":"low","tags":["操作系统: 网络","主题: 侦察发现","来源: 默认","对应需求: 侦察发现"],"timestamp_override":"event.ingested","type":"query","query":"data_stream.dataset:network_traffic.icmp\n  and (network_traffic.icmp.request.type:(13 or 15) or icmp.request.type:(13 or 15))\n  and destination.ip:(\n    10.0.0.0/8 or\n    172.16.0.0/12 or\n    192.168.0.0/16\n  )\n  and not source.ip:(\n    10.0.0.0/8 or\n    100.64.0.0/10 or\n    127.0.0.0/8 or\n    169.254.0.0/16 or\n    172.16.0.0/12 or\n    192.168.0.0/16 or\n    192.0.0.0/24 or\n    192.0.0.0/29 or\n    192.0.0.8/32 or\n    192.0.0.9/32 or\n    192.0.0.10/32 or\n    192.0.0.170/32 or\n    192.0.0.171/32 or\n    192.0.2.0/24 or\n    192.175.48.0/24 or\n    192.31.196.0/24 or\n    192.52.193.0/24 or\n    192.88.99.0/24 or\n    198.18.0.0/15 or\n    198.51.100.0/24 or\n    203.0.113.0/24 or\n    224.0.0.0/4 or\n    240.0.0.0/4 or\n    \"::1\" or\n    \"FE80::/10\" or\n    \"FF00::/8\"\n  )\n","threat":[{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1018","name":"Remote System Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1018/"}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0007","name":"Discovery","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0007/"}},{"framework":"MITRE ATT&CK","technique":[{"id":"T1595","name":"Active Scanning","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1595/","subtechnique":[{"id":"T1595.001","name":"Scanning IP Blocks","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/techniques/T1595/001/"}]}],"tactic":{"id":"TA0043","name":"Reconnaissance","reference":"https://attack.mitre.org/tactics/TA0043/"}}],"false_positives":["合法变更窗口内的运维、发布或安全扫描"],"interval":"5m","related_integrations":[{"package":"network_traffic","version":"*"}],"investigation_fields":{"field_names":["@timestamp","source.ip","destination.ip","destination.port","network.protocol","network.direction","tls.server.x509.subject.common_name","dns.question.name","host.name","user.name","message"]},"version":2,"immutable":true,"rule_source":{"type":"external","is_customized":true,"customized_fields":[{"field_name":"name"},{"field_name":"description"},{"field_name":"note"},{"field_name":"setup"},{"field_name":"false_positives"},{"field_name":"tags"},{"field_name":"investigation_fields"}],"has_base_version":true},"actions":[],"exceptions_list":[],"risk_score_mapping":[],"severity_mapping":[],"required_fields":[],"output_index":"","revision":1,"enabled":true,"max_signals":100,"to":"now"}
